      "expect": { "ids": ["n1", "n2"] },
      "surfaces": ["lib", "http", "cli", "python", "js", "go"],
      "note": "ORDER BY knn(...) takes a literal vector; MCP's text-native `query` tool refuses it (U4's law), so mcp is not in this case's surfaces."
